{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/43194-who-else-is-freezing","id":43194,"title":"Who else is freezing?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-05T16:03:56-08:00","id":43194,"title":"Who else is freezing?","content":"It is 26F here in Northeast TX right now, expecting to get to 15F later tonight. I had to pull a shawl out because I can chilled to death. Definitely not good for the fibromyalgia...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T16:35:33-08:00","id":43208,"title":"","content":"Very sorry to hear your fibromyalgia is being such a bother, JadedTrueBrujah. I've read a couple of other threads on the forum with your posts on how you feel, and many well-wishes to you in the hopes you feel better. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> As for myself, I'm honestly starting to wonder if now would be a good time to visit a couple of WoD ideas I had; all these reports in the media about the cold in North America is giving me material for my current chronicle. They involve spirits from Pluto, Uranus and Neptune somehow falling to Earth and bringing interstellar cold with them. Heck, might even get a few more words out of it for the First Tongue dictionary I still need to finish....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T16:44:10-08:00","id":43214,"title":"","content":"-11F with -31F wind chill. Going to drop down to -25/-51 tonight. Welcome to Minnesota.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1249-yawgmoth","name":"Yawgmoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1249_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T16:56:57-08:00","id":43226,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yawgmoth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/43194-who-else-is-freezing?p=43214#post43214\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-11F with -31F wind chill. Going to drop down to -25/-51 tonight. Welcome to Minnesota.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, there's one upside:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://beerstreetjournal.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/02/Snow-Beer-Fridge1.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Also, for those who want to see American weather warnings at a glance: <a href=\"http://www.weather.gov/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.weather.gov/</a><br /> <br /> I use a lot of mapping stuff for chronicle ideas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T17:47:01-08:00","id":43245,"title":"","content":"-1 and dropping fast here in Madison. A wind chill of -20 tonight.<br /> <br /> Looking forward to a high of -11 tomorrow, with wind chill down to -50. They've closed the schools and lots of people are staying home. They have warming locations gearing up for people without proper shelter.<br /> <br /> -MMM","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Owner/Editor - FlamesRising.com","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/949-matt-m-mcelroy","name":"Matt-M-McElroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar949_2.jpeg","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T18:19:47-08:00","id":43258,"title":"","content":"I'm cold in NC, It doesn't really drop below 10 degrees but that's plenty cold since I'm in an Unheated basement, and its jacking up my health condition. I want to move back to Michigan but the Temp is like sometimes 20 degrees below zero.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T18:25:29-08:00","id":43259,"title":"","content":"It's not freezing, but here in Southeast Texas, our projected high temperature for tomorrow is 42 F. A few weeks ago I was so acclimated to the cold that I could walk around in weather like that in shorts and a tee shirt; then I moved back here and I need a down jacket if it gets close to 50.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","name":"Daydreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T18:39:21-08:00","id":43266,"title":"","content":"The predicted high for tomorrow is -1F. I may have to find my cat and get him inside for a little while.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T18:47:13-08:00","id":43267,"title":"","content":"68 out right now. the only good thing about florida is the winter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T18:54:38-08:00","id":43272,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/43194-who-else-is-freezing?p=43267#post43267\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">68 out right now. the only good thing about florida is the winter.</div> </div> </div> </div>I once contemplated the implications of what would happen when one of America's prime snowbird roosts and vacationing spots were to freeze over like Hell after something impossible happened.<br /> <br /> This is the mental image that came to mind:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zd7c5tQCs1I\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zd7c5tQCs1I\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zd7c5tQCs1I\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zd7c5tQCs1I </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T18:57:17-08:00","id":43273,"title":"","content":"Few points of advice if you're not used to dealing with freezing cold weather.<br /> <br /> If it's getting particularly cold that night, you might want to eat the slightly higher water bill and leave some taps running a little bit. It's much harder for the water to freeze solid and burst pipes expensively if the water is flowing.<br /> <br /> If your tiny little heaters are not cutting it, always remember that you've got a giant heater in the kitchen. The stove. Turning it on high and cracking the door open, while not the best thing from a safety point of view (hot oven door being open) it does a wonderful job of heating the room up.<br /> <br /> Those ceiling fans you have for keeping yourself cool in the summer? They work the other way too you know, getting the hot air back down from above your head can help.<br /> <br /> Encourage people to stay in one room together, preferably in the center of the house. You can make it into a camp-out inside thing if you want, but focusing heating in the center of the house and turning the outside rooms into additional buffer space also helps to keep things warm. It also helps trap body heat, which is a good thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T19:01:04-08:00","id":43274,"title":"","content":"It snowed and we got about 8 inches here a couple nights ago. Then it dropped to about 9 degrees. Now it's all melting away, and the temperature is about 40. Tomorrow the temp is supposed to hit 50, but then plunge back to 5 degrees at night.<br /> <br /> I'm confused.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T19:01:56-08:00","id":43275,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/43194-who-else-is-freezing?p=43273#post43273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Few points of advice if you're not used to dealing with freezing cold weather.<br /> <br /> If it's getting particularly cold that night, you might want to eat the slightly higher water bill and leave some taps running a little bit. It's much harder for the water to freeze solid and burst pipes expensively if the water is flowing.<br /> <br /> If your tiny little heaters are not cutting it, always remember that you've got a giant heater in the kitchen. The stove. Turning it on high and cracking the door open, while not the best thing from a safety point of view (hot oven door being open) it does a wonderful job of heating the room up.<br /> <br /> Those ceiling fans you have for keeping yourself cool in the summer? They work the other way too you know, getting the hot air back down from above your head can help.<br /> <br /> Encourage people to stay in one room together, preferably in the center of the house. You can make it into a camp-out inside thing if you want, but focusing heating in the center of the house and turning the outside rooms into additional buffer space also helps to keep things warm. It also helps trap body heat, which is a good thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also buy a kotatsu <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kotatsu\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kotatsu</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T20:15:28-08:00","id":43307,"title":"","content":"7 degrees out, it's snowing, somewhere below zero after the windchill. Sometimes Colorado isn't so fun. On the plus side, I don't have to go to work tonight.<br /> <br /> AnubisXy","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T21:41:59-08:00","id":43346,"title":"","content":"-6 here and supposed to be wind chills of -40 to -65 tomorrow. Now if only my dog would learn how to go to the bathroom outside quickly...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1385-nickpire84","name":"Nickpire84","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1385_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T22:53:03-08:00","id":43361,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/43194-who-else-is-freezing?p=43275#post43275\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Also buy a kotatsu <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kotatsu\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kotatsu</a></div> </div> </div> </div>It's called Brazera in Spanish and its heated with coals similar to old Roman device; just haul that old ball grill in and fill with coal and place dense stones such as Sauna stones to cook on the coals to trap heat and you're set... Ofc the fire risk is there but properly watched it shouldn't cause problems or too much smoke and you can do the same with an electric grill.<br /> <br /> Manwhile in Northern Europe: Where's my god damn winter you cunts! It's still frickin' +3c and the last time we had even a fraction of snow in the ground was in November.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1700-blue-fox","name":"Blue Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-05T23:19:23-08:00","id":43370,"title":"","content":"Got a projected high of 27 and low of 17 for today. This part of Utah has pretty mild winters, and low enough rainfall that we don't see a lot of snow no matter what the temperature is. I do feel bad for everyone further east getting crapped on by the sky this season.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please add signature.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/615-the-hanged-man","name":"The Hanged Man","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-06T06:19:09-08:00","id":43469,"title":"","content":"Here in Southern California, the main concern is winds and wildfires: my car\u2019s reading of the outside temperature this morning was 57\u00b0F.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-06T06:43:18-08:00","id":43483,"title":"","content":"-7 degrees F last night, MIGHT get above freezing today for the high, 3 degrees F on my drive into work this morning and about 2 inches of snow that had fallen on Saturday still lingering about. That's the weather report from the southern edges of the Denver/Boulder region of Colorado.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://