","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T14:15:17-08:00","id":46489,"title":"","content":"Well, it's finally thawing out. The FedEx Deliveries came in at the proper time for the first time this week, and the temperature is all the way up in the sixties here in the Dallas area. This has severely distorted my sense of what is &quot;normal&quot;, for the time being: I'm pretty sure I could walk outside in shorts and sandals and still feel downright toasty after the last week.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T14:28:52-08:00","id":46500,"title":"","content":"It is forty-something degrees and raining. Not only does the rain help melt all the snow, it's rinsing all the mud and soot and salt off my car. I can see out of my side windows again!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T14:52:24-08:00","id":46517,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div