1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T08:33:08-08:00","id":65717,"title":"","content":"29F here right now. Got my sweatpants on and the trailer is warm for once. Yes, the temp is affecting my back so I took some Tramadol.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T09:57:17-08:00","id":65783,"title":"","content":"It seems to me that we've had snowstorms almost every week since the beginning of the year. Another foot is expected Sunday.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-05T11:18:46-08:00","id":65822,"title":"","content":"4 above 0 F for the high today, down to negative double digits for tonite and last night.<br /> <br /> I had a snowman knock on my door last night asking to come in and sleep on the couch.<br /> <br /> The local pet store has started stocking penguins since they'll actually be comfortable here now.<br /> <br /> Mother Nature left home and moved south. She is no longer on speaking terms with Father Winter.<br /> <br /> The ice fishers have having trouble keeping the fish IN the water. They keep trying to leap into the deep fryer.<br /> <br /> I saw a hitchhiker with a sign that said &quot;anywhere above 40 degrees&quot;.<br /> <br /> My wife is rearranging the furniture in the living room because it's sliding on the ice so easily.<br /> <br /> The local clothing store was robbed by a gang of polar bears looking for fur coats.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-08T09:21:35-08:00","id":67937,"title":"","content":"It started snowing here yesterday just enough to cover the steps and leaves. No black ice on the way to town this morning. A blue jay tried to attack me when I walked by the bird feeder (damn bird!).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-11T16:18:25-08:00","id":70114,"title":"","content":"It's warming up here too. 13 Degrees above Zero. And my Droid says it'll get up to 30 Degrees over the next few days!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-12T04:47:16-08:00","id":70493,"title":"","content":"29F and it sleeted and then snowed yesterday. I got a blood test to do later and Mom has to do a MRI on her back. Thank goodness for Kindles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-16T15:03:08-07:00","id":92481,"title":"","content":"I'd hate to say this, but it's 86F out here right now; summer has come in January; it's seems like just about every week, there's a day that goes over 80F then it cools down a bit to 70F and then the heat comes back. Though it's nice out, this is not good for California that is in the middle of a drought; the large cities are lucky: they have large reserves of water but the small-cities do not. It's also not good when I have a sun-burn in January and I have to constantly wear sunscreen and hats when I go outside; last year, it was a lot colder!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}